---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Projects">
  <section class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-4 animate-fade-in-up">
        Projects
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-12 animate-fade-in-up delay-100">
        A selection of my technical projects in AI, data engineering, and backend development.
      </p>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <!-- AI Predictive Maintenance System -->
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 hover:border-blue-300 dark:hover:border-blue-600 transition-all shadow-sm hover:shadow-md">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-4">
            AI Predictive Maintenance System
          </h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-6">
            An AI-based predictive maintenance system for industrial/aircraft engines using the NASA C-MAPSS FD001 dataset. The system predicts Remaining Useful Life (RUL) to enable proactive maintenance decisions.
          </p>

          <div class="mb-6">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-2">Problem</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm">
              Unexpected equipment failures cause significant downtime and costs. Traditional time-based maintenance is inefficient. This project aims to predict equipment failure before it occurs.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-6">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-2">Solution</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm">
              Built a Random Forest model trained on sensor data from aircraft engines. The system provides RUL predictions and maintenance recommendations through a REST API.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-6">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-2">Key Features</h3>
            <ul class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm space-y-1">
              <li>• Data preprocessing and feature engineering from raw sensor data</li>
              <li>• Random Forest regression for RUL prediction</li>
              <li>• FastAPI backend with PostgreSQL database</li>
              <li>• SQLAlchemy ORM for data management</li>
              <li>• Maintenance decision support system</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-6">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 text-sm rounded-full">Python</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 text-sm rounded-full">Machine Learning</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 text-sm rounded-full">Random Forest</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 text-sm rounded-full">FastAPI</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 text-sm rounded-full">PostgreSQL</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 text-sm rounded-full">SQLAlchemy</span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <a href="#" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-700 dark:hover:text-blue-300 font-semibold text-sm">
              GitHub →
            </a>
            <a href="#" class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-700 dark:hover:text-slate-300 font-semibold text-sm">
              Demo →
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Employee Performance Prediction -->
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 hover:border-blue-300 dark:hover:border-blue-600 transition-all shadow-sm hover:shadow-md">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-4">
            Employee Performance Prediction
          </h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-6">
            An AI application for predicting employee performance using machine learning. The system helps organizations identify high-potential employees and areas for development.
          </p>

          <div class="mb-6">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-2">Problem</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm">
              Organizations struggle to objectively assess employee performance and identify talent early. Traditional reviews are subjective and infrequent.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-6">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-2">Solution</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm">
              Developed a Random Forest classifier that predicts performance categories based on employee attributes. Built an interactive Streamlit interface for easy use by HR teams.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-6">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-2">Key Features</h3>
            <ul class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm space-y-1">
              <li>• Feature engineering from employee data</li>
              <li>• Random Forest classification model</li>
              <li>• Interactive Streamlit dashboard</li>
              <li>• SQLite database for data storage</li>
              <li>• Model performance metrics and visualizations</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-6">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 text-sm rounded-full">Python</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 text-sm rounded-full">Machine Learning</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 text-sm rounded-full">Random Forest</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 text-sm rounded-full">Streamlit</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 text-sm rounded-full">SQLite</span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <a href="#" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-700 dark:hover:text-blue-300 font-semibold text-sm">
              GitHub →
            </a>
            <a href="#" class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-700 dark:hover:text-slate-300 font-semibold text-sm">
              Demo →
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Geo-Economic Intelligence Platform -->
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 hover:border-blue-300 dark:hover:border-blue-600 transition-all shadow-sm hover:shadow-md">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-4">
            Geo-Economic Intelligence Platform
          </h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-6">
            An AI-first platform for analyzing economic patterns across geographic zones. The platform helps identify economic trends, opportunities, and risks across different regions.
          </p>

          <div class="mb-6">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-2">Problem</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm">
              Economic data is complex and geographically dispersed. Organizations need tools to analyze patterns across regions to make informed strategic decisions.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-6">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-2">Solution</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm">
              Built a Django-based platform that aggregates economic data, applies ML analysis, and provides insights through interactive dashboards and reports.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-6">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-2">Key Features</h3>
            <ul class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm space-y-1">
              <li>• Data aggregation from multiple economic sources</li>
              <li>• Geographic data analysis and visualization</li>
              <li>• ML-based pattern recognition</li>
              <li>• Django web framework with PostgreSQL</li>
              <li>• Interactive data dashboards</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-6">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 text-sm rounded-full">Django</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 text-sm rounded-full">Python</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 text-sm rounded-full">Machine Learning</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 text-sm rounded-full">PostgreSQL</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 text-sm rounded-full">Data Analysis</span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <a href="#" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-700 dark:hover:text-blue-300 font-semibold text-sm">
              GitHub →
            </a>
            <a href="#" class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-700 dark:hover:text-slate-300 font-semibold text-sm">
              Demo →
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- RAG / AI Agent Project -->
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 hover:border-blue-300 dark:hover:border-blue-600 transition-all shadow-sm hover:shadow-md">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-4">
            RAG / AI Agent System
          </h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-6">
            A Retrieval-Augmented Generation system capable of extracting and reasoning over company information. The system combines LLMs with vector search for accurate, context-aware responses.
          </p>

          <div class="mb-6">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-2">Problem</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm">
              General-purpose LLMs lack specific company knowledge and can produce inaccurate information. Organizations need AI systems that understand their specific context and data.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-6">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-2">Solution</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm">
              Built a RAG system that indexes company documents, retrieves relevant context using vector search, and generates accurate responses using LLMs with proper citation.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-6">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-2">Key Features</h3>
            <ul class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm space-y-1">
              <li>• Document ingestion and chunking pipeline</li>
              <li>• Vector embeddings and similarity search</li>
              <li>• LLM integration for response generation</li>
              <li>• Context-aware query processing</li>
              <li>• Source citation and transparency</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-6">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 text-sm rounded-full">Python</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 text-sm rounded-full">RAG</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 text-sm rounded-full">LLMs</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 text-sm rounded-full">Embeddings</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 text-sm rounded-full">Vector Search</span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <a href="#" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-700 dark:hover:text-blue-300 font-semibold text-sm">
              GitHub →
            </a>
            <a href="#" class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-700 dark:hover:text-slate-300 font-semibold text-sm">
              Demo →
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
